muse-gadget-protocol (Kotlin)

This module is a Kotlin port of the Linux Device SDK from Meta's open-source
Muse Gadgets project, https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk
(linux/src/musegadget), Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Derived files: everything under src/main/kotlin. Test vectors in
src/test/resources/link_pairing_v5.json are copied unchanged from the upstream
repository (public synthetic data). noise_vectors.json is generated from the
upstream Python code by tools/gen_noise_vectors.py.

This is an unofficial personal project. It is not made by, endorsed by, or
affiliated with Meta. Use of the Muse Gadget SDK token is subject to the Gadget
SDK Terms (personal, non-commercial use).
